CORE
contract.sol
--contract St --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 1 --path-cov-assert spec.json
^ERROR: --path-cov-assert: unit '[^']*' -- REFUSING THE LADDER: path enc=99 is not among this unit's 2 enumerated path\(s\)
would print VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL for a ladder it never built
\A(?!(.|\n)*^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$)
\A(?!(.|\n)*^VERIFICATION FAILED$)
